204
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:36,970
My…

205
00:13:37,910 --> 00:13:39,530
My father he…

206
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,370
He shouldn't have been named Teng.

207
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:46,490
You...

208
