232
00:16:00,460 --> 00:16:01,970
Milady,

233
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:03,090
hold on a little longer.

234
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:05,610
Wang Zhuo,

235
00:16:07,070 --> 00:16:08,730
in this next life,

236
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:10,930
