240
00:16:16,230 --> 00:16:18,130
It's born !

241
00:16:23,160 --> 00:16:27,410
That year, your soul was sucked away in the Foreign Battlefield.

242
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:30,720
It turns out you found a great fortune there,

243
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:33,410
Wang Lin...

244
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:35,090
Ancestor !

245
00:16:35,130 --> 00:16:36,930
Teng Family City is sealed.

246
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:37,970
What ?

247
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:39,610
