249
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,130
I order you

250
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:49,250
to wake up Teng One !

251
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:04,010
Not only did they take the spiritual energy from the mortal's Spirit Roots,

252
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:07,170
